        VALUES ('4f88e25d-7521-4d37-885e-7a932b1f3c3a', 32, '[2,2 ball]  Qopchada har biri 8 tadan moviy va qizil sharlar bor.  Ketma-ket olingan ikki shardan ikkalasining ham moviy bo‘lish ehtimolligini toping.', 'multiple_choice', '{"options":["1  4","7  15","7  30","1  8  Topshiriqlar (33-35) va javob variant (A-F) larini o‘zaro moslashtiring.  Uzunligi 6 m va asosining radiusi 5 dm ga teng bo‘lgan silindrsimon shakldagi yog‘och bo‘lagidan eng katta hajmli to‘g‘ri burchakli parallelepiped shaklidagi yog‘och ustun yasaldi.  Bo‘yi Eni Yog‘och bo‘lagi"]}', '"A"', null, null);
